{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/HH_Description_Title.png?t=1747660864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Honest Helper</strong>\u00a0is a top-down, grid-based strategy game where you use time manipulation to defeat all enemies without any casualties. This cute and charming game will challenge your tactical and decision making skills across 30+ levels for hours on end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/Gravestone_GIF.gif?t=1747660864\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Graveyards and Gravesouls!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You</strong> embody a powerful being who can control <i>time</i>. They use this power to go back through history and visit graveyards, conjuring the &quot;soul&quot; of those long deceased in hopes of giving them a longer lease at life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/Attacking_Wolf.gif?t=1747660864\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Command to Victory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to save these &quot;souls,&quot; you will need to command their movement and choice of attacks. This also includes any coordinated team strategies that might be required in order to &quot;save&quot; the souls of all those in the graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/Making_Bubble.gif?t=1747660864\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bubbles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bubbles</strong>\u00a0are the main way you will be able to save these unfortunate &quot;souls.&quot; Bubbles are pockets in <i>time</i> that act as a separate part of the same environment. This is the <strong>only</strong> way you will be able to turn the tides of the battlefield when the &quot;souls&quot; are heavily outnumbered and outgunned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/Victory.gif?t=1747660864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Good Luck!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720430?t=1747660864","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720430?t=1747660864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/27ee0d117deb1f0b80d5978a839755c460273a0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747660864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/27ee0d117deb1f0b80d5978a839755c460273a0b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747660864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"