 team strategies that might be required in order to &quot;save&quot; the souls of all those in the graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/Making_Bubble.gif?t=1747660864\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bubbles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bubbles</strong>\u00a0are the main way you will be able to save these unfortunate &quot;souls.&quot; Bubbles are pockets in <i>time</i> that act as a separate part of the same environment. This is the <strong>only</strong> way you will be able to turn the tides of the battlefield when the &quot;souls&quot; are heavily outnumbered and outgunned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/extras/Victory.gif?t=1747660864\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Good Luck!</strong></p>","developers":["Adam Robichaux"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720430/04233db03b48e22ae39c0d952efd82ba530df59d/header.jpg?t=1747660864","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257141433,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.c